        "heading_m8jAyh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Re[Sens]– THE FIRST HIGH-TECH SUSTAINABLE BRAND SPECIALIZING IN SENSITIVE SKINCARE"
          }
        },
        "richtext_BX4zqX": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We work in the field of neurocosmetics, exploring the connection between emotional state and skin responses. <strong>The combination of </strong><a href=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/sensi-cosmetology\" title=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/sensi-cosmetology\"><strong>sensi-,</strong></a><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/neurocosmetology\" title=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/neurocosmetology\"><strong>neuro-</strong></a><strong>, and </strong><a href=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/immuno-cosmetology\" title=\"https://resenss.com/en/pages/immuno-cosmetology\"><strong>immuno-cosmetology</strong></a> allows us to create formulas that don’t suppress the skin — they understand it.</p><p>At the heart of Re[Sens] are advanced biotechnologies that gently activate natural regeneration mechanisms and enhance the skin’s resilience to stress, with deep respect for the microbiome and individual needs.</p><p>We <strong>integrate the most advanced, carefully selected raw materials from Japan, Korea, the USA, and the EU into our own unique formulas, clinically tested and proven</strong>. Re[Sens] cosmetics are EU-certified and meet the highest quality standards.</p><p>To support the skin’s natural microbiota, <strong>we use an innovative microbiome-friendly preservation system </strong>that ensures safety without disrupting the skin’s balance.</p><p>Each product embodies <strong>the concept of “Slow Beauty” </strong>— a gentle, balanced approach to skincare without overloading the skin. The brand’s formulas are enriched with an optimal blend of anti-inflammatory, hydrating, and soothing components for comprehensive support of skin health, comfort, and barrier integrity.</p>",
            "text_size": 16
          }
        }
      },
