        "title": "SENSI-COSMETOLOGY",
        "text": "<p>Re[Sens] was born as a brand that works with sensitive skin not by “shutting it down,” but through understanding and respecting its reactions. Sensi-cosmetology is a modern skincare approach based on knowledge of receptors, sensory neurotransmission, the microbiome, and barrier function.</p>",
        "button_label": "Read More",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/sensi-cosmetology"
