    },
    "image_image_with_text_TDLfVc": {
      "type": "image--image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "colors": "light",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1920x1080_NEUROCOSMETOLOGY.svg",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "section-width": "full",
        "layout": "right",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "title": "NEUROCOSMETOLOGY",
        "text": "<p>Neurocosmetology is a core direction for Re[Sens], based on the modern understanding of skin as a component of the neuro‑endocrine system. Skin perceives not only external stimuli — touch, temperature — but also internal states: fatigue, stress, emotional tension. By influencing the skin’s sensory neurons, neurocosmetology can also modulate brain function.</p>",
        "button_label": "Read More",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/neurocosmetology"
      }
    },
    "image_image_with_text_h7GhHz": {
      "type": "image--image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "colors": "light",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1920x1080_IMMUNO-COSMETOLOGY.svg",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "section-width": "full",
        "layout": "left",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "title": "IMMUNO-COSMETOLOGY",
        "text": "<p>Immunocosmetology is a contemporary skincare direction that works with the skin’s internal defence resources, rather than merely addressing irritation or inflammation symptoms.</p><p>Unlike traditional care, immunocosmetics don’t mask symptoms — they modulate local (epidermal) immunity, helping the skin restore balance, reduce reactivity, and maintain stable barrier function.</p>",
        "button_label": "Read More",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/immuno-cosmetology"
      }
    },
    "image_image_with_text_twyaaB": {
      "type": "image--image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "colors": "light",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1920x1080_MICROBIOME-FRIENDLY.svg",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "section-width": "full",
        "layout": "right",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "title": "MICROBIOME-FRIENDLY PRESERVATION SYSTEM",
        "text": "<p>The skin microbiome is not just a barrier — it’s a living, intelligent ecosystem. Its balance is critical to health, regulating inflammation, supporting hydration, strengthening immunity, and modulating skin’s response to stress.</p>",
        "button_label": "Read More",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/microbiome-friendly-preservation-system"
      }
    },
    "text_rich_text_efeY7Q": {
      "type": "text--rich-text",
